Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.95,1:05:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,她是唯一的幸存者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was the only survivor.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.62,1:06:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我和我妈一起坐飞机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was on a plane with my mom...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.39,1:06:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,当背包客  正穿过越南{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}backpacking across Vietnam.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.39,1:06:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,飞机就在丛林中坠毁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The plane just crashed in the middle of the jungle.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.13,1:06:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他们花了一个星期才找到我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It took them a week to find me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.57,1:06:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得那件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember that.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.03,1:06:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你上了新闻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were on the news.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.60,1:06:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我的大学室友和我一起乘船出海{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My college roommate and I took a boat out...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.14,1:06:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不知从哪里冒出一个大浪把船掀翻了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a wave came out of nowhere and just... flipped the boat over.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.42,1:06:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我试图抓住绳子  结果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I tried to grab a line and, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.15,1:06:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,差点失去了我的拇指{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}almost took my thumb off.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.79,1:06:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,又潮又冻  我们就紧紧抓着船体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wet,freezing, just holding on to the hull...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.76,1:06:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,只有一件外套  而我们有两个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with only one jacket between the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.33,1:06:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,内森  他开始变得好斗和迷惑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Nathan, he started getting aggressive and confused.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.94,1:06:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他们后来在医院告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was signs of hypothermia,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.84,1:06:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那是体温过低的迹象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they told me later in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.54,1:06:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,内森  回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nathan, come back!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.94,1:07:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,第二天  他游了出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the second day, he swam off.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.68,1:07:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道他在那边看到了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what he thought he saw out there...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.31,1:07:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我除了大海什么都没看到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but there was nothing but ocean.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.68,1:07:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,又过了一天  海岸警卫队只找到了我一人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The next day, the Coast Guard found me alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.46,1:07:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那你呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.86,1:07:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我是我朋友里第一个买车的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was the first of my friends to get a car.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.53,1:07:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,当时是寒假  我们正在度过一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was winter break and we were having this...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.97,1:07:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,美妙的夜晚  我想开车带大家出去兜风{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}great night and... I wanted to take everybody out on a joy ride.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.31,1:07:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我喝得很醉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was wasted.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.82,1:07:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我和另外11个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me and 11 others were
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.62,1:07:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,在西维吉尼亚州的一个矿井里工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}working a mine in West Virginia...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.69,1:07:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,其中包括我弟弟  卡尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}including my little brother, Cal.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.69,1:07:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,然后发生了塌方  职业风险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was a cave-in. Occupational hazard.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.73,1:07:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我和卡尔紧挨在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me and Cal got pinned right next to each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.37,1:08:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我看不见他  但我可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't see him, but I could, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.07,1:08:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我能听到他慢慢窒息的声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could hear him suffocating slowly.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.08,1:08:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我听着他咽最后一口气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard him take his last breath.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.42,1:08:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,当救援人员到达时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the time the rescue crew got there,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.28,1:08:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我是唯一活着的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was the only one alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.72,1:08:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他们知道我们的一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They knew everything about us...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.19,1:08:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,每一个该死的细节  他们知道那件外套{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}every goddamn detail. I mean, they knew the jacket...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.09,1:08:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我室友在船上穿的那件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that my roommate was wearing on that boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.20,1:08:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,红鼻子驯鹿鲁道夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Rudolph the Red-Nosed Reindeer," that's the...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.56,1:08:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我们出车祸时播放的歌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}song that was playing when we crashed.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.67,1:08:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他们为我们订制了这些房间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They made these rooms for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.57,1:08:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他们向我们信任的人发了邮件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They addressed the boxes from people that we trust.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.37,1:08:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我侄子给我发短信说  "祝你玩得愉快"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My nephew texted me, "Have a good time."
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.28,1:08:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他们窃听了他的电话  这是丹尼的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They hacked his goddamn phone. It's Danny's.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.68,1:08:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,一氧化碳中毒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carbon monoxide poisoning.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.49,1:08:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,除了他  他家里所有人都死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone in his family was killed but him.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.89,1:08:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都没死  对吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None of us died, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.13,1:08:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们是唯一的幸存者  -那又怎么样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're sole survivors. So what?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.09,1:08:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是统计学上来说不可能的幸存者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're a statistical improbability.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.30,1:09:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,现在他们想看看谁会是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now they want to see who will be
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.10,1:09:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,幸运儿中最幸运的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the luckiest among the lucky.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.47,1:09:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你有没有勇气让余无坦医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have the heart to let Dr. Wootan Yu...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.91,1:09:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,帮助你成为一个更好的你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}help you become a better you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.94,1:09:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,通过测试你的极限打开新世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open new doors by testing your limits.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.68,1:09:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不要满足于单调的生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't settle for a humdrum existence.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.25,1:09:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,生活到极致{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Live life to the extreme.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.39,1:09:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,在接下来的五分钟内下订单{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Place your order in the next five minutes
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.39,1:09:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,就能享受免费的度假{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and receive a complimentary getaway.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.66,1:09:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  至少我们知道还有多少时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, well, at least we know how much time we have.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.42,1:09:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,知道什么时候会死真是种巨大的安慰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, knowing exactly when I'm going to die is a huge comfort.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.09,1:09:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不明白吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you guys not understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.93,1:09:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他们挑选了我们去死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They chose us to die
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.83,1:09:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,来测试谁是最后一个活着的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to see who's the last person standing.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.40,1:09:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在需要你在状态  和我们一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need you on board right now, okay? Stay with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.67,1:09:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能只按他们的规则玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't just keep playing by their rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.94,1:09:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还能做什么  他们在监视我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What else are we supposed to do? They're watching us.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.10,1:09:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他们知道我们的一举一动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They know every move that we're making.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.61,1:09:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在监视我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're watching us.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.28,1:09:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我找到了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got something.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.86,1:10:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,快点  快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.69,1:10:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我拿着呢  给{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it. Here, here.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.80,1:10:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,好  我们有什么线索{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh. Okay. What do we have?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.80,1:10:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,一个拳头  一个手指和两个手指{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A fist, one finger, and two fingers.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.66,1:10:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,它可能是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It could be...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.34,1:10:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是0  1  2吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It could be zero, one, two, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.00,1:10:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧  像个密码{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right? Like a code.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.01,1:10:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不  不  不  这是拼写{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. It spells...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.18,1:10:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,E-K-G{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}E-k-g.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.11,1:10:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  这是手语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's sign language.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.78,1:10:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我表哥聋了  他们一定也知道这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My cousin is deaf. They must have known about that, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.55,1:10:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有心电图吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there an EKG machine here somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.56,1:10:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.52,1:10:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,量子芝诺效应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quantum Zeno effect.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.54,1:10:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你一直连续测量  原子就不会改变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Atoms won't change if you take continuous measurements...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.33,1:10:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,只要他们在观察我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so as long as they're watching us,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.00,1:10:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就不能改变状态{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we can't change our state.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.40,1:10:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏是为了让他们能赢而设计的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The game is designed so they always win.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.80,1:10:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,可我们现在真的需要你的帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, okay. We could really use your help right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.37,1:10:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不  我们可以找到另一条出路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. We can find another way out.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.18,1:10:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们甚至不知道第一条出路是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't even know the first way out.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.58,1:10:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,别捣乱了  深呼吸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just stop smashing shit and take a deep breath.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.91,1:10:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你有没有勇气让余无坦医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have the heart to let Dr. Wootan Yu
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.08,1:10:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,帮助你成为一个更好的你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}help you become a better you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.18,1:11:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,佐伊  你得冷静一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Zoey, you need to calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.02,1:11:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,三分钟后  他们就会毒死我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In three minutes, they're going to poison us.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.22,1:11:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的时间不多了  你必须冷静下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are running out of time here. You've got to calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.23,1:11:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,别叫我冷静  好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop telling me to calm down, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.96,1:11:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你们没听我说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not listening to me!
