Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.66,1:16:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你想说什么  本{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you saying, Ben? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.37,1:16:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,注意你的用词{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Use your words.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.51,1:16:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你们两个抢一件外套{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One jacket between the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.27,1:17:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,把你外套给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your jacket!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.91,1:17:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他自己游走然后死掉倒是挺省事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's pretty convenient that he just swam off and died.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.05,1:17:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会想这么做的  伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't want to do this, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.42,1:17:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直活到现在根本不是靠运气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You being the sole survivor had nothing to do with luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.32,1:17:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,承认吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Admit it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.89,1:17:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你杀了他  快承认你杀了你的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You killed him! Admit that you killed your friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.96,1:17:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,生存与否是个选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surviving is a choice!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.60,1:17:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,该你选了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.94,1:17:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,睁大眼睛好好找线索吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep your eyes open and look for clues.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.11,1:17:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  这是个舱门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, it's a hatch.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.62,1:17:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们应该只要打开就行了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess we just open it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.82,1:17:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,然后再进什么鬼地方吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we letting in?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.79,1:17:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,行吧  开就开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine, I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.69,1:17:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-它太重了  -得了吧 用点力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's heavy. - Come on, try harder.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.86,1:17:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋  我又不是每天都去健身{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asshole, I don't go to the gym every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.86,1:17:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,没用的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.71,1:18:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,加把劲  加把劲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.25,1:18:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我手上都是什么玩意儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this shit on my hands?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.46,1:18:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我不太舒服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't feel so good.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.60,1:18:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  喂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.66,1:18:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在把手上涂了什么东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They put something on the handle.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.34,1:18:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  你化了  你在融化{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you're melting. You're melting.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.34,1:18:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-你说啥  -你在融化{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - You're melting.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.77,1:18:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,什么  等下  看这个上面写着什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Wait. Look, look. It says something.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.21,1:18:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,离开之前再看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Feel free to leave, but may we note...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.28,1:18:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,最好找到解药再走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's best to find the antidote."
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.72,1:18:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这个样子要怎么找啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How the hell are we supposed to do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.20,1:19:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,站起来好好找找啊  没用的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up and look, goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.96,1:19:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,找个屁  反正都得死在这{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who cares, man? We're going to die here anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.23,1:19:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会死的  我不想死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going to die. I'm not going to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.25,1:19:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.39,1:19:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪  解药在哪呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is it? Come on. Come on. Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.92,1:19:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,狗日的解药到底他妈在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is this bastard? Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.04,1:19:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,(解药 一剂 注射型)
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.53,1:19:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,本  本{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ben. Ben.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.47,1:19:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-我找到了解  -把它给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I have the anti... - Give me that!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.39,1:20:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's mine!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.33,1:20:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,操{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.40,1:20:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,操他妈的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.32,1:21:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.83,1:21:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,行了  这有十个数字  四个空{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I've got ten numbers, four spots.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.70,1:21:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要一个四位的密码{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a four-digit code.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.84,1:21:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,进入五号房间  正在待命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Entering room five. Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.17,1:21:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,准备行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Standing by.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.47,1:21:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,发现两具尸体  完毕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have two bodies. Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.15,1:21:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,收到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.42,1:21:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,20分钟以内清理尸体  完毕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}20 minutes for disposal and cleanup. Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.22,1:21:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,收到  出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy. Out.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.16,1:21:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,看那个  氧气面罩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at that, the oxygen mask.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.60,1:21:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,她打算用那个干什么啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell was she going to do with that?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.76,1:21:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,当然是呼吸了  混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breathe, bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.85,1:22:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,操{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.12,1:23:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你竟然是匹黑马{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you were a dark horse.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.76,1:23:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我还赌是杰森来着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My money was on Jason.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.59,1:23:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,但是  看吧  这就是这个游戏如此吸引人的原因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, see, that's why these games are so fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.46,1:23:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不知如何  在经历了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somehow, after being burnt,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.30,1:23:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,烧伤  冻伤  毒伤  并且瘸着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}frozen, poisoned, and crippled...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.66,1:23:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你竟然是最终成功逃到了这里的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you still managed to escape the final room.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.27,1:23:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你有想过自己身体里有这么能量吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you ever think you had that in you?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.94,1:23:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,肾上腺素  那种驱动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That adrenaline, that drive?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.34,1:23:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,坐下  庆祝一番{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down. Celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.11,1:23:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你第一次赢了些什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won something for once.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.65,1:23:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,所以就是你这个神经病  设计了这个害人不浅的迷宫吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you're the psycho that designed this murder maze, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.52,1:23:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不  我是游戏大师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm the Games Master.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.85,1:23:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是拼图师设计的房间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Puzzle Maker designs the rooms.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.12,1:23:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,但你以杀人为乐  屏幕上都留着的  都不是什么好玩意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you kill people for fun. There's nothing good left on TV?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.16,1:24:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你杀了你所有的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You killed all your friends...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.17,1:24:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,就因为你不想付出租车的钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because you didn't want to pay for a goddamn cab.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.57,1:24:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我就不会那么心安理得  本{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't get too comfortable on that high horse, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.80,1:24:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道 文明的最初{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the beginning of civilization...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.64,1:24:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,人类就对于观看同类自相残杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we've known there was something captivating...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.87,1:24:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,有种别样的兴趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about watching human beings fight for their lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.38,1:24:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,因此我们爱看角斗士  爱看公开处刑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why we watch gladiator games, public executions...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.01,1:24:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,爱堵在路边看车祸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}rubber-necking on the freeway.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.92,1:24:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但是现在世界的进程太平缓了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now the world's gone soft.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.38,1:24:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,所有事都很安全  所有事都很小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything is safe. Everything is careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.39,1:24:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们为那些仍然渴求野性的人们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, we created a sport for people
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.32,1:24:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,打造了一个舞台{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who still have a thirst for savagery...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.56,1:24:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,给他们提供包厢看台{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we provided them with a box seat
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.19,1:24:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,观赏生命终极的戏码{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for life's ultimate drama.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.63,1:24:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的顾客都是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our customers are some of the most powerful
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.14,1:24:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,在世界范围内有头有脸的人物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}people in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.24,1:24:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,但每年他们都想要更多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But every year, they demand more.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.34,1:24:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,更复杂的房间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More complicated rooms.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.84,1:24:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,更有趣的对象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More interesting subjects.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.71,1:24:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,更多不同的生死赌局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More ways to gamble on life and death.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.01,1:24:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,去年是一批大学运动员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last year, they had college athletes...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.02,1:24:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,前年是一批学者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the year before, savants...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.02,1:25:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,而今年主题是  唯一的幸存者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and this year we had lone survivors.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.92,1:25:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他们很好奇是否真的是运气在起作用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They wanted to know if luck had anything to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.73,1:25:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,幸运的人可不会被一群疯子绑架折磨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucky people don't get kidnapped and tortured by psychopaths.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.70,1:25:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗  当你说别人是疯子的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, it's kind of hurtful
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.43,1:25:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉还挺伤人的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you call someone a psychopath, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.54,1:25:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我也觉得挺愚蠢的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it was stupid, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.78,1:25:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,但现在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But here you are...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.51,1:25:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们赔率最高的选手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}our lowest-odds ever to win...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.58,1:25:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,活到了现在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}still alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.89,1:25:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的觉得不太可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really didn't think it was possible...
