Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.02,1:32:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那就去吧  干他的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'm in. Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.23,1:32:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你又不是杰森·伯恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not Jason Bourne, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.23,1:32:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-好吗  -好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.31,1:33:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧  应该在这的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. It's got to be in here.
