Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.75,1:33:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-这什么意思  -我也不知道  让我想想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What does that mean? - I don't know. Give me a second!
